2,-1,-1.23,-1.235,-1.235,0,-0.99,-0.99900000000000000000000000000000000000,-9.99
3,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL
---- TYPES
int,decimal,decimal,decimal,decimal,decimal,decimal,decimal,decimal
